  "guide": {
    "by": "Written by your Hermes model",
    "guide": [
      {
        "text": "The sources are Harborlight's FY26 program report and notes from a September 13 board retreat.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P1",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "FY26 Program Report",
            "locator": "“Who we served”",
            "source_id": "s_599bea6ee9e6"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P6",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Board retreat notes",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_726b0a630cd6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Harborlight enrolled 1,148 adult learners in fiscal year 2026, up from 936 the year before, and 287 adults were on the waitlist at year end.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P1",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "FY26 Program Report",
            "locator": "“Who we served”",
            "source_id": "s_599bea6ee9e6"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "FY26 Program Report",
            "locator": "“The waitlist”",
            "source_id": "s_599bea6ee9e6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Staff recommend an FY2027 budget of $1,610,000 to add a sixth site at the Eastgate branch library and two site coordinators.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "FY26 Program Report",
            "locator": "“Recommendation to the board”",
            "source_id": "s_599bea6ee9e6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Reserves stand at 3.2 months of operating expenses, below the board's target of 4 months.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P8",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Board retreat notes",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_726b0a630cd6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The board agreed to vote on the FY2027 budget on October 21.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P8",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Board retreat notes",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_726b0a630cd6"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "asks": [
      {
        "id": "a1",
        "who": "The board",
        "what": "One-page summary of the FY2027 budget request",
        "by": "the October 21 board meeting",
        "kind": "onepager",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P8",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Board retreat notes",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_726b0a630cd6"
          }
        ],
        "brief": {
          "who": "Harborlight board members",
          "goal": "Decide whether to approve the FY2027 budget",
          "length": "One page"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "a2",
        "who": "Board members",
        "what": "Short deck for funders about the sixth site",
        "by": "",
        "kind": "deck",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P8",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Board retreat notes",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_726b0a630cd6"
          }
        ],
        "brief": {
          "who": "Funders",
          "goal": "Support the sixth site at the Eastgate branch library",
          "length": "A short deck"
        }
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "text": "Reserves are 3.2 months against a target of 4 months. How can the board approve a budget that rises $190,000, from $1,420,000 to $1,610,000?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P8",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Board retreat notes",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_726b0a630cd6"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P3",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "FY26 Program Report",
            "locator": "“Money”",
            "source_id": "s_599bea6ee9e6"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 3,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "FY26 Program Report",
            "locator": "“Recommendation to the board”",
            "source_id": "s_599bea6ee9e6"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "The waitlist holds 287 adults, and the sixth site would serve 180 more learners a year. Why would that only cut the waitlist in half?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "FY26 Program Report",
            "locator": "“The waitlist”",
            "source_id": "s_599bea6ee9e6"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "FY26 Program Report",
            "locator": "“Recommendation to the board”",
            "source_id": "s_599bea6ee9e6"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Most of the 287 waiting adults are at Eastgate and Riverside, but the new site is only at Eastgate. How will Riverside's nine-week average wait get shorter?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "FY26 Program Report",
            "locator": "“The waitlist”",
            "source_id": "s_599bea6ee9e6"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "FY26 Program Report",
            "locator": "“Recommendation to the board”",
            "source_id": "s_599bea6ee9e6"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      }
    ],
